        "line": 213,
        "text": "noncomputable def cylindricalCurl (R : D → ℝ) (Vr Vθ Vz : D → D) (a : D → ComplexVector) (x : D) : ComplexVector := ![(R x)⁻¹ • along Vθ (fun y => a y 2) x - along Vz (fun y => a y 1) x, along Vz (fun y => a y 0) x - along Vr (fun y => a y 2) x, along Vr (fun y => a y 1) x + (R x)⁻¹ • a x 1 - (R x)⁻¹ • along Vθ (fun y => a y 0) x]"
      },
